{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689050/extras/afc7b64afdd716426a28201ed407c638.poster.avif?t=1758909164\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689050/extras/afc7b64afdd716426a28201ed407c638.webm?t=1758909164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689050/extras/afc7b64afdd716426a28201ed407c638.mp4?t=1758909164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEMO \u2013 WHAT DOES IT OFFER?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019ve prepared a demo that fully reflects the main game for you. First, you\u2019ll see exactly what kind of game awaits you. Of course, we\u2019re keeping plenty of extra content for the full release. But even in the demo, there\u2019s more than enough content waiting: 2 playable maps, 1 running boss, weapons \u2013 enemies \u2013 abilities, and much more.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SHOW YOUR RUN ON 2 DIFFERENT MAPS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In completely random and differently themed maps, the only thing unaffected by probability is you! No matter what map \u2013 enemy \u2013 trap \u2013 boss you encounter, you\u2019ll have to take them all down to break the loop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689050/extras/c0476d05248d8bdf17fe12856e3f45ec.poster.avif?t=1758909164\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689050/extras/c0476d05248d8bdf17fe12856e3f45ec.webm?t=1758909164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689050/extras/c0476d05248d8bdf17fe12856e3f45ec.mp4?t=1758909164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ACCEPT THE CARDS AND BUILD YOUR ABILITY SET</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During your runs, listen to the merchants who offer you different abilities or challenges. Trust me, they\u2019ve got cards you\u2019ll like. Don\u2019t hesitate to try building your own special ability set with the powers you acquire. And don\u2019t worry\u2014every time you die, you\u2019ll get another chance to try again.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3689050?t=1758909164","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3689050?t=1758909164","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689050/c9a1b784842acc53c6d85e4d545f0806d78adc32/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758909164","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689050/c9a1b784842acc53c6d85e4d545f0806d78adc32/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758909164","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689050/extras/afc7b64afdd716426a28201ed407c638.poster.avif?t=175890916