fferent abilities or challenges. Trust me, they\u2019ve got cards you\u2019ll like. Don\u2019t hesitate to try building your own special ability set with the powers you acquire. And don\u2019t worry\u2014every time you die, you\u2019ll get another chance to try again.</p>","developers":["42nd Machine"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3332790","name":"Rogue Runner"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689050/695995b35f6e83ca3e2a023b730dfea85a2c75cd/header.jpg?t=1758909164","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Rogue Runner Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> TBA<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> TBA<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBA<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["42nd Machine"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia\nLinguagem impr\u00f3pria","rating":"14","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"14","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Drastische Gewalt\nSchimpfw\u00f6rte","rating":"16","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"16","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Coming soon"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689050/1ee207e038d381e00850b7e2e1e469d100260c77/ss_1ee207e038d381e00850b7e2e1e469d100260c77.1920x1080.jpg?t=1758909164","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689050/1ee207e038d381e00850b7e2e1e469d100260c77/ss_1ee207e038d381e00850b7e2e1e469d10026